   "text": "{\"archived\":false,\"description\":\"The Attendance Monitoring System is a web-based application built using HTML, CSS, PHP, Bootstrap, and MySQL. It allows administrators and teachers to record, manage, and analyze student attendance efficiently. The system provides detailed summaries, absence tracking, and attendance statistics to improve monitoring and reporting.\",\"full_name\":\"chryshalou/Attendance-Monitoring-System\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/chryshalou/Attendance-Monitoring-System\",\"id\":1053206350,\"language\":null,\"license\":null,\"topics\":[]}\nThe Attendance Monitoring System is a web-based application built using HTML, CSS, PHP, Bootstrap, and MySQL. It allows administrators and teachers to record, manage, and analyze student attendance efficiently. The system provides detailed summaries, absence tracking, and attendance statistics to improve monitoring and reporting.",
